  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A number of people modify the SDK so that it allows them to upload even if it exceeds the polygon limit. Often for the purposes of annoying or crashing other people.\nIf the game already knows how many polygons an avatar has, it should be that the server checks again if the uploaded avatar exceeds the polygon limit and it it does, it is unusable and/or deleted.",
